TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    GitHub repository traffic per UTC day for public pollinations repos, synced daily by
    .github/workflows/data-sync-github-traffic-tinybird.yml. GitHub keeps only 14 days, so each
    run re-sends the window; query with FINAL to keep the latest fetch per day. uniques are
    per-day unique visitors/cloners and must not be summed into a period-unique total.

SCHEMA >
    `repo` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.repo`,
    `metric` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.metric`,
    `date` Date `json:$.date`,
    `count` UInt32 `json:$.count`,
    `uniques` UInt32 `json:$.uniques`,
    `fetched_at` DateTime `json:$.fetched_at`

ENGINE "ReplacingMergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "repo, metric, date"
ENGINE_VER "fetched_at"
